# Privacy Policy

**Last updated: November 21, 2026**

Modern Cards ("the app") is an offline entertainment utility: a deck of cards for magic tricks. Your privacy matters to us, and the app is built so that your information stays on your device. This policy explains what the app does and does not do with your data.

## Information We Collect

Modern Cards does not collect, store, or transmit any personal information to us or to any third party. We operate no servers and use no analytics, tracking, or advertising. We never see your data.

## Data Stored on Your Device

Your settings, the card that was chosen, the force card, and the words you type for the widgets are stored locally on your device only. The app shares them with its own widgets through storage on your device. This information never leaves your device and is removed when you delete the app.

## Widgets

The Peek and Force Input widgets read the chosen card and your widget settings from storage on your device. Widgets are visible on your Home Screen and Lock Screen, so anyone who can see your screen can see them. Nothing they show is sent anywhere.

## Camera

The app uses the camera only for two optional features. On iPhone Duo, "Show spread to spectator" needs an active camera session for iOS to show the app on the outer screen; these camera frames are not recorded, stored, or sent. For the APAAN trick, the camera takes a photo only when you touch and hold the screen to take it. The camera is never used in the background, and iOS shows its camera indicator whenever it is on.

## Photos

If you allow access, the app reads only the most recent photo in your photo library, to show it on a card in the APAAN and ACAAN tricks. With limited access, it can see only the photos you choose. A photo you take for APAAN is saved to your camera roll. No photos are ever uploaded or shared by the app.

## Motion and Hinge Sensors

The app uses your device's motion sensors to shuffle the cards when you shake the phone and to know when the phone is held upright. On iPhone Duo it also reads the hinge angle to spread the cards as the phone opens. These readings are used in real time on your device and are never stored or sent.

## Network & Third Parties

The app is designed to function entirely offline. It makes no network requests, contains no analytics or advertising software, and includes no third-party tracking technologies. Because nothing is transmitted off your device, there is no data for us or any third party to receive. The Instagram and Facebook links in Settings open only when you tap them, in that app or in your browser, where their own privacy policies apply.

## Children's Privacy

The app does not knowingly collect information from children or from anyone else, as it does not collect personal information at all.

## Changes to This Policy

We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page along with a revised date above.

